# PWA
#
# `public/sw.js` is NOT ignored. It is hand-written and committed — see
# REDESIGN_PLAN §5.4. It used to be listed here, left over from a next-pwa
# template, which meant `git add public/sw.js` silently no-opped: CI and the
# Docker image would have shipped an application whose /sw.js 404s, with every
# test green. The two lines below are for generated files this project does not
# produce, and are kept only so a future plugin cannot commit its output by
# accident.
public/workbox-*.js
public/worker-*.js

# ESLint
.eslintcache

# Biome
.biome/

# Turbo (if used later)
.turbo/

# Tesseract language data. Downloaded by tesseract.js into the working
# directory on first OCR run, so it is a build artefact, not a source asset.
# A 3.3 MB binary does not belong in the history.
*.traineddata

# Ralph-loop session state. Per-session and per-machine — it carries a session
# id and an iteration counter, so committing it means the next checkout inherits
# somebody else's half-finished loop.
.claude/ralph-loop.local.md
